# Outer joins whose ON clause ties one column of the joined table to two columns of the
# preceding side, as in ON pa.x = pb.k AND pa.y = pb.k, which implies pa.x = pa.y.
# The expected rows come from DuckDB with every = rewritten to IS NOT DISTINCT FROM,
# because QuestDB treats NULL = NULL as true in join keys and filters. The tables are not
# partitioned, so they are not WAL tables and inserted rows are visible at once.

# ==== INT keys ====

statement ok
